<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[NAME]</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>&nbsp;</b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:
minor-latin">Right now, the Red Cross has an immediate need for blood</span></b><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin">. Thank
you for working hard to organize your upcoming blood drive.<b> </b>Your blood
drive plays an important role during this time to ensure there are no delays in
medical treatment for patients in need.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:
minor-latin"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><b>When donors come to give blood </b><b><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin">Oct. 21
thru Nov. 9 they’ll get a $10 gift card* by email. Plus, they’ll be
automatically be entered to win a $5,000 gift card.^^ There will be one winner
a week!</span></b><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;color:#242424"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">As you continue the work to make your drive a success –
remember to use these tips:</p><ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b>Fill
     your schedule.</b> Use these tools to recruit blood donors and schedule
     them using the Blood Drive Management Portal.<o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b>Encourage
     donors to schedule a donation for a friend.</b> Each additional donor
     scheduled means more lives saved!<o:p></o:p></li>
</ul>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to reach
out – I’m always here to help!<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><b>IMPORTANT: Donors MUST have a valid email address on file
to receive their reward. <o:p></o:p></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">All the best,</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[NAME]</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;ArialMT&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:
ArialMT;color:#9A9A9A">*Presenting donors who receive this offer and present to
donate during the applicable promotional time&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 154, 154); font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; font-size: 9.5pt;">frame are eligible to receive the above described e-gift
card(s). This offer is non-transferable and not&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 154, 154); font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; font-size: 9.5pt;">redeemable for cash. Limit one (1) per presenting donor
unless otherwise indicated. If a presenting donor&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 154, 154); font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; font-size: 9.5pt;">qualifies for multiple offers, the donor will only
receive the higher offer unless otherwise indicated.&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 154, 154); font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; font-size: 9.5pt;">Instructions on how to redeem the gift card will be
emailed to the address listed on the presenting donor’s&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 154, 154); font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; font-size: 9.5pt;">American Red Cross donor profile approximately thirty
(30 days after attempted donation(s). All gift cards&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 154, 154); font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; font-size: 9.5pt;">are subject to individual merchant terms and conditions,
and all trademarks are property of their&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 154, 154); font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; font-size: 9.5pt;">respective owners. Merchants and offers are subject to change. No substitutions by presenting donors.&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 154, 154); font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; font-size: 9.5pt;">American Red Cross is not responsible for lost, damaged,
corrupted or stolen gift cards and may replace&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 154, 154); font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; font-size: 9.5pt;">any such cards at its sole discretion. Any questions or
problems in connection with redeeming gift cards&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 154, 154); font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; font-size: 9.5pt;">must be directed to the merchant.</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;ArialMT&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:
ArialMT;color:#9A9A9A"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;ArialMT&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:
ArialMT;color:#9A9A9A">^^Void where prohibited. Void in Puerto Rico, any U.S.
territories and outside the United States and&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 154, 154); font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; font-size: 9.5pt;">where prohibited by law. Open to legal residents of U.S.
states and DC, age 18+ (19+ in NE and AL; 21+&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 154, 154); font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; font-size: 9.5pt;">in MS) at entry. The Giveaway Period begins 12:00 a.m.
ET on 10/21/23; ends 11:59 p.m. ET on 11/09/23&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 154, 154); font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; font-size: 9.5pt;">and includes three (3) separate Entry Periods as
follows: 10/21/2023-10/27/2023 (drawing date on or&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 154, 154); font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; font-size: 9.5pt;">about 11/2/2023; 10/28/2023 to 11/3/2023 (drawing date
on or about 11/9/2023; and 11/4/2023 to&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; color: rgb(154, 154, 154);">11/9/2023 (drawing date on or about 11/16/2023). </span><b style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial-BoldMT&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:
Arial-BoldMT;color:#9A9A9A">NO PURCHASE OR DONATION NECESSARY. </span></b><span style="font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; color: rgb(154, 154, 154);">To&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 154, 154); font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; font-size: 9.5pt;">enter either present to donate blood at an American Red
Cross blood donation facility or send an email to&nbsp;</span><b style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial-BoldMT&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:
Arial-BoldMT;color:#666666"><a href="mailto:customercare@redcross.org">customercare@redcross.org</a>
</span></b><span style="font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; color: rgb(154, 154, 154);">and include the Giveaway name,
"American Red Cross 2023 $5K a&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 154, 154); font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; font-size: 9.5pt;">Week." There is a limit of three (3) total Entries
permitted per Entrant, regardless of method of Entry,&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 154, 154); font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; font-size: 9.5pt;">during the Giveaway Period. Three (3) prizes will be
awarded during the Giveaway Period, with one&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; color: rgb(154, 154, 154);">awarded each Entry Period. Winners will receive one (1)
$5,000 Visa</span><span style="font-size: 7pt; font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; color: rgb(154, 154, 154);">® </span><span style="font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; color: rgb(154, 154, 154);">Prepaid
gift card. Total ARV of all&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; color: rgb(154, 154, 154);">prizes: $15,000. Odds of winning depend on number of
entries received. </span><b style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial-BoldMT&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-bidi-font-family:Arial-BoldMT;color:#666666">click here. </span></b><span style="font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; color: rgb(154, 154, 154);">Sponsor: American&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 154, 154); font-family: ArialMT, sans-serif; font-size: 9.5pt; background-color: white;">Red
Cross.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:16.8pt;margin-left:
0in;line-height:16.8pt;background:white"><o:p></o:p></p><br><p></p>]]></td>
</tr>
